cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite the thesis below."
title: "QuantaLatent: a controlled comparison of latent-step formulations for multi-agent collaboration"
abstract: >-
  Harness and experiment matrix comparing five latent-step formulations
  (ridge realignment, soft, Gumbel-softmax, categorical sampling, and Mixture
  of Inputs) across three inter-agent communication media and four tasks on a
  local Qwen3-8B, holding agent topology, prompts, backbone, and questions
  fixed.
type: software
